{"id":"n81585-1-8","stage":3,"title":"초봄 · 初春","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81585-1-8-1","ko":"날이 따뜻한 줄 알았는데 아직은 좀 쌀쌀하네요.","zh":"我原以为天气已经变暖和了，其实现在还是有点冷呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날이","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날：天气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"3","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따뜻한","meaning":"暖和","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","explanation":"줄：所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았는데","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직은","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌀쌀하네요.","meaning":"凉飕飕","explanation":"쌀쌀하다：凉飕飕；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"쌀쌀하다","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66104","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀쌀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"每一天的雨、云、风、气温等的状态。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"86c4cc835736d415","term":"쌀쌀하다","zh":"凉飕飕","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3","entryId":"66104","definition":"天气凉，感觉稍冷。","pronunciation":["쌀쌀하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/96e606e279f00fa84239.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81585-1-8-2","ko":"네, 아직 초봄이라 아침저녁으로는 꽤 추워요.","zh":"是的，因为现在还是初春，早晚的时候相当冷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"초봄이라","meaning":"初春，早春","explanation":"초봄：初春，早春；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"초봄","audio":"/audio/e0f4ed54272439ee781f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81585","senseId":"1","lemma":"초봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침저녁으로는","meaning":"早晚，朝夕","explanation":"아침저녁：早晚，朝夕；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아침저녁","audio":"/audio/152d068cd58c4898cefd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93384","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워요.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e0f4ed54272439ee","term":"초봄","zh":"初春，早春","audio":"/audio/e0f4ed54272439ee781f.mp3","entryId":"81585","definition":"春季开始的一段时间。","pronunciation":["초봄"]},{"id":"152d068cd58c4898","term":"아침저녁","zh":"早晚，朝夕","audio":"/audio/152d068cd58c4898cefd.mp3","entryId":"93384","definition":"早上和晚上。","pronunciation":["아침저녁"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/828c7a71a8c07426101f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81585","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我原以为天气已经变暖和了，其实现在还是有点冷呢。","是的，因为现在还是初春，早晚的时候相当冷。","家里突然出了急事，所以昨天没能去参加聚会。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我原以为天气已经变暖和了，其实现在还是有点冷呢。","是的，因为现在还是初春，早晚的时候相当冷。","家里突然出了急事，所以昨天没能去参加聚会。"],"answer":1}]}
